 olive/yellow/teal palette. Stable mask and proportions. Keep torso centered at constant scale; no world travel, camera movement, zoom, turning or perspective change. Entire boots, reeds, bell and hook remain inside the canvas. Background stays perfectly uniform PURE MAGENTA RGB(255,0,255) throughout all frames. Never replace magenta with green or yellow. No floor, cast shadows, scenery, gradients, text, smoke, magical particles, motion blur or extra objects.",
